- The fuel cells `service()` keeps (~5% of the hold) are left aboard automatically, so selling all of `settled` is safe.
- Every library function is `await`ed, and all seven names used (`orient`, `gatherUntil`, `goTo`, `sell`, `service` — `note` isn't needed here) come from the single `'play'` import, so the static gate should pass.

